=2 Walkthrough
* This quest is flagged upon completion of the previous quest, {q:No Rest for the Weary|No Rest for the Weary|No Rest for the Weary}.
* Engage in and complete the three tier VI Voidwatch battles in the following past areas:
** {m:Gaunab} in {z:Vunkerl Inlet (S)}. (F-5), (G-8), (G-13)
*** Both the {p:Atmacite Refiner} teleport (available in shadowreign areas only) and the {p:Survival Guide} to {z:Vunkerl Inlet (S)} take you (E-7), not very far south of the (F-5) planar rift.
*** The (F-5) location can also be reached by taking {p:Survival Guide} to {z:Batallia Downs (S)}, zoning into nearby {z:Jugner Forest (S)}, then hugging left and zoning into {z:Vunkerl Inlet (S)} at (L-6). There, it is just a short trip south-west.
*** Campaign teleport to {z:Vunkerl Inlet (S)} takes you to (H-10), roughly in the middle between the (G-8) and (G-13) locations.
** {m:Ocythoe} in {z:Grauberg (S)}. (D-14), (G-7), (G-11)
*** The (G-7) planar rift is not too far from the campaign teleport to {z:Grauberg (S)}.
** {m:Kalasutrax} in {z:Fort Karugo-Narugo (S)}. (D-12), (I-11), (K-8)
*** The (I-11) planar rift is not far south from where the campaign teleport to {z:Fort Karugo-Narugo (S)} places you.
