* Speak to any Shadowreign (past) era {p:Voidwatch Officer} to receive a {k:Voidwatch alarum}.
* Return to the Bulwark Gate in {z:Sauromugue Champaign (S)} for a cutscene that ends this quest and starts the next quest, and for your reward.

